{"alias":"/data-reporting/privacy/policies","title":"Maine DOE Data Policies","changed":"2026-04-06T23:03:29+00:00","before":"<p>The Maine Department of Education (Maine DOE) governs the data it stewards in accordance with federal and state laws, such as the federal Family Educational Rights and Privacy Act (FERPA),&nbsp;the Individuals with Disabilities Education Act (IDEA), state regulations (i.e. 34 CFR 300.610 -646), and Maine statute&nbsp;(i.e.&nbsp;Title 20-A:&nbsp;§6005). &nbsp;The following policies contain information about the processes and procedures used to ensure the confidentiality of personally identifiable information (PII) and how data can be accessed by stakeholders.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"14d80e9b-bcec-4d59-9379-e0a2d2232762\" filename=\"DATA - Maine Department of Education Data Breach Insurance Statement - 06.21.2021.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/DATA%20-%20Maine%20Department%20of%20Education%20Data%20Breach%20Insurance%20Statement%20-%2006.21.2021.pdf\" title=\"Data Breach Insurance Document\">Maine Department of Education Data Breach Insurance</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"1ddba601-91cd-40ab-8cb7-f7bd5f21d65d\" filename=\"DATA - Maine Department of Education Database Data Retention - 03.03.2025.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/DATA%20-%20Maine%20Department%20of%20Education%20Database%20Data%20Retention%20-%2003.03.2025.pdf\" tabindex=\"-1\" title=\"Data Retention Policy\">Maine Department of Education Data Retention</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document 